<title>Guía: levantar el sitio en local y crear un blog — Regain Hope Detox</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #222; line-height: 1.45; }
  h1 { font-size: 20pt; color: #1a1a1a; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #333; padding-bottom: 6pt; margin-top: 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 14pt; color: #1a1a1a; margin-top: 22pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 4pt; }
  h3 { font-size: 12pt; color: #333; margin-top: 16pt; }
  h4 { font-size: 11pt; color: #333; margin-top: 12pt; }
  p { margin: 6pt 0; }
  ul, ol { margin: 6pt 0 6pt 18pt; }
  li { margin: 3pt 0; }
